n weights, its own grain measures. A necessary and often frustrating aspect of this study, has been reducing all these differences to the metric system, which was not fully adopted by the Kingdom of the Netherlands until 1821." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 856, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 790})
